{"productId": "02b0e80a-e244-4da2-8515-158a1d079bd2", "modelName": "P-10 C", "modelDescription": "The CZ P-10 C is much more than just our take on the striker-fired pistol, from the way it feels to the way it shoots. The CZ grip angle, a mild palm swell, deep beavertail, and three interchangeable backstraps make the gun fit a wide variety of hands as if it were built for them. Designed to minimize creep and stacking, the P-10's trigger breaks at a clean 4-4.5 lbs and rebounds with a short, positive reset, meaning single shots can be meticulously placed while follow-ups are effortless. Its fiber-reinforced polymer frame and hardy nitride finish are made for the daily grind. A generous trigger guard allows use with gloved hands while being undercut to allow as high a grip as possible, and a set of metal tactical 3-dot sights allow for one-handed manipulation of the slide on a belt. Like all CZ pistols, the P-10 is built with our legendary cold hammer forged barrel. The C in the name indicates that it is compact in both frame and slide size.", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "2e6bcedb-9a6f-470a-8975-a16c1735bd7a", "description": "CZ, P-10C, Semi Automatic, 9mm, 4\" Ported Barrel, Black Finish, Aimpoint COA Red Dot, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/c4402d82-74de-4853-b75e-32b5052d1b3d", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/90058c2c-a974-4dfe-a6d7-08452c4c6708", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/0752cc27-e25f-4840-89d4-8e3258c696db", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/22454e83-46f4-4156-b293-05af23ffdaa6", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/173bbf71-ad6b-412e-9fab-434ce095b8c8"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "01582", "upc": "806703015828", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2fa81b83-a1b1-4729-b87f-fbaba467061c", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "f24